<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Efɛsi Kaane Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔli Alaa Falan Naxan Nasiga Efɛsi Kaane Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efɛsi Kaane</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efɛsi Kaane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alaa Falan Naxan Nasiga Efɛsi Kaane Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli yi kasoon nan na Romi taani a Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛ waxatin naxan yi, a yi a rasiga Efɛsi kaane ma. Koni, a mi yi waxi a xɔn ma Efɛsi kaane gbansanna xa a xaran. A luxi alo a yi kɛdini ito rasigama Efɛsi kaane dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan nun a rabilinna taane dɛnkɛlɛya yamane nan ma Asi yamanani alogo e birin xa a xaran. Nayi, a mi muxu wuyaxi xɔntɔnxi a kui, a mɔn mi Efɛsi kaane maxadi e sɔnne fe yi. Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi nɛn alo ɲɛɛ tonge saxan ɲɔxɔn Yesu te xanbini ariyanna yi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xɛra Pɔli fa nɛn Efɛsi taani a xɛraya sigatiin saxandeni, a yi ɲɛɛ saxan naba na. (Xɛrane 19.1 han 20.1) Kitabun yireni ito sora 3.1 nun 4.1 nan a yitama en na a xɛraan yi kasoon nan na a yi ito sɛbɛma Efɛsi kaane ma waxatin naxan yi. A mɔn itoe fan sɛbɛ kasoon nan na: Filipi Kaane, Filemɔn, e nun Kɔlɔsi Kaane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito fala yisoxini ito ra fa fala Ala feen birin nagidixi nɛn alogo “A xa seen birin malan, naxanye kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna ma, a yi a Muxu Sugandixin findi ne birin xunna ra.” (1.10) Ala a dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan nan findixi Yesu fati bɛndɛn na dunuɲa yi alogo a xa dunuɲa feene birin malan Yesu yamarin bun. Nayi, dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan lan nɛn e sariɲan e dunuɲa yi gidini. Lanna xa lu yamaan ni alogo Yesu a yamaan lanna xa findi a binya xunna ra dunuɲa nun kore xɔnna ma. Ala to dunuɲa muxune birin malanma alogo a xa binyen sɔtɔ kore xɔnna ma, en tan sese mi lan en yi na lanna kala en nun muxun bodene tagi fɔ en na en yɛtɛ magodo en bode xa, en sariɲan. (5.21)</para>
  <para style="ip">A Kitabun yireni ito fɔlɔxi duban nan ma (1.1-2) a yi a raɲan duban ma. (6.21-24) Falan naxan tixi Kitabun kui, a yitaxunxi dɔxɔ firin: A singena (1.3-3.21), Ala naxan ligaxi en xa a Muxu Sugandixin Yesu xɔn, Pɔli yelin xanbini a sɛwan mayitɛ na fe ra, a yi dɛnkɛlɛya muxune lan feen yɛba, a yi a yita en na Ala Yahudiyane nun siya gbɛtɛne malanxi kii naxan yi, e findi yama kedenna ra, a yamana. A firindena (4.1-6.20), xɛrana a falama a Kitabun xaran muxune lan nɛn a e xa findi kedenna ra nii nɛnɛni Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu nin. A yi a yɛba lanna luma e nun bonne tagi kii naxan yi dɛnkɛlɛya yamani e nun denbayani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli Alaa yamaan lan feen nan yɛbama misali saxan xɔn: fati bɛndɛn lanna nun banxin ti kiina nun lanna xɛmɛn nun a ɲaxanla tagi. Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu luxi alo fati bɛndɛn xunna, e nun alo banxin bundɔxɔ gɛmɛna. Dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan mɔn luxi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa nɛn alo ɲaxanla a xɛmɛn xa. Nayi, en na a toma nɛn fa fala lanna mi luyɛ dɛnkɛlɛya muxune tagi xa muxune mi xɛtɛ hakɛn nun yulubin fɔxɔ ra, e la Marigin na.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>N tan Pɔli naxan findixi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina xɛraan na Ala sagoon xɔn ma, n tan nan ito sɛbɛma yama sariɲanxin ma Efɛsi taani, tɔgɔndiya muxun naxanye Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>En Fafe Ala nun en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa hinanna nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi ɛ ma.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">En barakan naxan sɔtɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>En barikan bira en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Fafe Ala xa naxan niin duban birin nagidixi en ma ariyanna yi a Muxu Sugandixini. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Benun dunuɲa xa da waxatin naxan yi, Ala bata yi en sugandi nun alogo en xa sariɲan, en lu fɛtareyani a yɛɛ ra yi. Ala bata yi a ragidi a xanuntenyani, <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>a xa en findi a diine ra Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani alo a rafan a ma a yɛtɛɛn sagoni kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Na yi findi Ala hinan gbeen kanna tantun xunna ra a naxan fixi en ma a xanuntenna xɔn.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Amasɔtɔ en bata xunba Yesu wunla xɔn ma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.7</char> <char style="fk">Yesu wunla xɔn ma:</char> Na bunna nɛɛn, fa fala a sayaan xɔn ma.</note> en yulubine yi xafari, a yi a hinan dɛfexi gbeen mayita, <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Ala bata naxan nagidi en ma a faɲin na a fekolonna nun a xaxilimayaan birin yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>A bata a sagoon wundo feen makɛnɛn en xa, a rafan feen naxan nagidi Yesu barakani <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>alogo a xa na rakamali a waxatin na a li. Na sagoon ni i ra fa fala a xa seen birin malan, naxanye kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna ma, a yi a Muxu Sugandixin findi ne birin xunna ra.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>En mɔn sugandixi en xa lu Yesu yi, alo Ala bata yi a ragidi en ma kii naxan yi nun, Ala naxan feen birin nakamalima a yɛtɛ a maragidin nun a sagoon xɔn. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Na ligaxi nɛn alogo en tan naxanye singe bata en yigi sa Alaa Muxu Sugandixini, en xa findi tantun seen na Ala binyen kanna xa.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Ɛ tan fan bata lu Yesu yi, ɛ to ɲɔndin falan mɛxi, ɛ rakisi fe Xibaru Faɲina, ɛ yi la Yesu ra, Ala yi a Nii Sariɲanxin lu ɛ yi a taxamasenna ra, a bata yi en tuli sa naxan na. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin luxi nɛn alo Ala se singen naxan soxi en yii taxamasenna ra alogo en xa a kolon en sa kɛɛn sɔtɔma nɛn Alaa yamaan na xunba waxatin naxan yi, en yi Ala tantun a binyeni.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli a Ala maxandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Nanara, xabu n na ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyana fe mɛ Marigi Yesu ma e nun ɛ xanuntenyana yama sariɲanxin birin xa, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>n barikan birama Ala xa ɛ fe yi waxatin birin, n nɛma Ala maxandɛ ɛ xa. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>N Fafe Ala, binyen kanna maxandima ɛ xa, en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina Ala alogo a xa a Nii Sariɲanxin nagodo ɛ ma naxan fe kolonna fima, a feene makɛnɛn alogo ɛ Ala kolonna xa fari sa. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>N na Ala maxandima ɛ xa alogo ɛ xa feene yɛɛ to ɛ bɔɲɛni, a fixa, alogo a ɛ xilixi yigin naxan ma, ɛ xa na kolon, a bata kɛɛ nɔrɔxin binyen naxan lu a yama sariɲanxin xa, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>e nun a sɛnbɛ fisamantenna en tan dɛnkɛlɛya muxune xa. Na findixi a sɛnbɛ yɛtɛɛn nan na a naxan nawalixi a fanga gbeeni <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>a to a Muxu Sugandixin nakeli sayani, a yi a lu a yiifanna ma ariyanna yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>A yi a lu mangayane nun nɔyane nun sɛnbɛne nun kuntigiyane birin xun na e nun xinla naxanye birin nɔɛ falɛ dunuɲani ito yi e nun waxati famatɔni. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Ala bata seen birin lu Yesu sanna bun ma, a yi a findi e xunna ra dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xa. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan luxi nɛn alo Yesu fati bɛndɛna. Dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan Yesu a feene birin nakamalima, Yesu naxan feen birin nakamalima kiin birin yi.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">En kisima Alaa hinanna nan xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Ɛ tan fan, ɛ faxaxin nan yi a ra ɛ hakɛne nun ɛ yulubine fe ra, <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>ɛ yi sigan tima naxanye yi nun ɛ yi dunuɲa muxune fɔxɔ ra waxatin naxan yi, e nun bɔxɔn nun kuyen lan tagin yinnane mangana, na nii ɲaxin naxan walima Ala matandi muxune yi iki. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>A fɔlɔni nun, en fan birin yi en ma dunuɲa yi gidin ligama nɛn alo ne, en yi biraxi en fati bɛndɛn sagoon nan fɔxɔ ra, en yi en fati bɛndɛn nun en yugo ɲaxine natane liga. Nayi, fata en kɛɲaan na, Alaa xɔlɔn nan yi ragidixi en ma alo bodene.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Koni Alaa kininkininna gbo, a bata en xanu xanuntenya tilinxin na. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>En tan naxanye yi faxaxi en hakɛne fe ra, Ala bata en niin bira en yi a Muxu Sugandixin barakani. Ɛ kisixi Alaa hinanna nan xɔn ma. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Ala bata en tan nun Yesu rakeli en bode xɔn ma sayani, en yi dɔxɔden sɔtɔ Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fɛma ariyanna yi, <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>alogo a xa a hinan tilinxi fisamantenna mayita waxati famatɔne yi a fanna xɔn a naxan yitaxi en na Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ kisixi Alaa hinanna nan xɔn dɛnkɛlɛyaan barakani. Na mi fataxi ɛ tan xan na, Alaa kiseen na a ra. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Ɛ katan tɔnɔn xa mi a ra, nayi muxu yo mi nɔɛ a yɛtɛ matɔxɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Ala wali xɔnna nan en na. A bata en da Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani, alogo en xa wali faɲine raba, Ala bata yi naxanye yitɔn en yɛɛ ra, alogo en xa sigan ti ne xɔn ma.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yama kedenna nan dɛnkɛlɛya muxune birin na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Ɛ tan naxanye barixi siyaan bonne yɛ, Yahudiyane naxanye yatɛxi banxulantarene ra fati bɛndɛn kiraan xɔn, n xa a rabira ɛ ma ɛ yi kii naxan yi a fɔlɔni nun: <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Ɛ mi yi Alaa Muxu Sugandixini na waxatini. Ɛ mi yi lan nun ɛ Isirayila tɔnɔne sɔtɔ, Alaa yamana. Xɔɲɛne nan yi ɛ ra. Layiri yo mi yi ɛ nun Ala tagi. A mi yi ɛ tuli saxi sese ra. Yigi yo mi yi ɛ ma, Ala mi yi ɛ yi dunuɲa yi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Koni iki Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini, ɛ tan naxanye yi makuya nun, iki ɛ bata maso a ra Alaa Muxu Sugandixin wunla xɔn ma. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>A tan nan lanna rasoxi en birin tagi. A bata Yahudiyane nun siya gbɛtɛne findi yama kedenna ra, a to a fati bɛndɛn fi, alogo a xa na danna kala naxan yi en tagi taxunxi yaxuyani. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>A tan nan sariyan nun a yamarine nun tɔnne ɲan, a yi na yama firinne birin findi muxu nɛnɛ kedenna ra a yɛtɛ xa, a bɔɲɛ xunbenla rafa e tagi, <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>a e nun Ala tagini tɔn a sayaan xɔn a faxa wudin ma, e yi lan e bode ma alo gbindi kedenna, a e yaxuyaan kala. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Yesu yi fa, a bɔɲɛ xunbenla Xibaru Faɲin nali ɛ tan ma, naxanye yi makuya Ala ra nun e nun Yahudiyan naxanye yi maso a ra. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Yesu nan kiraan nabama en tan yama firinna birin xa, siga Fafe Ala yɛtagi a Nii Sariɲanxin barakani.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Nanara, ɛ tan naxanye mi yi Alaa yamani, xɔɲɛ mi fa ɛ ra. Ɛ bata findi dugurenne ra yama sariɲanxini. Ɛ bata so Alaa denbayani. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Ɛ bata lu alo banxin naxan bɛtɛn saxi gɛmɛne ra. Na gɛmɛne findixi xɛrane nun nabine nan na. Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yɛtɛɛn nan banxin tongon gɛmɛ kɛndɛn na. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Banxin yiren birin tugunxi e bode ra, a te a tan barakani, a yi findi Ala Batu Banxi sariɲanxin na Marigin xa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>A ɛ nun bonne tugunma nɛn ɛ bode ra a tan barakani, ɛ lu alo banxina Ala dɔxɔma naxan yi a Nii Sariɲanxini.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔli a wanla siya gbɛtɛne xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Nanara, n tan Pɔli Ala maxandima ɛ tan siya gbɛtɛne xa, n tan kasorasana Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe ra. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>N laxi a ra, ɛ bata a mɛ Ala hinanna naxan nagidixi n ma alogo n xa ɛ mali. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Ala bata a wundo feen kolonna makɛnɛn n xa, alo n bata a fena nde sɛbɛ ɛ ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Ɛ na n ma sɛbɛnla xaran, n xaxinla naxan sɔtɔxi Alaa Muxu Sugandixina wundo feni, ɛ na yɛɛ toma nɛn. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Wundo feni ito mi makɛnɛnxi singe ra muxune xa, koni Ala bata a makɛnɛn a xɛra sariɲanxine nun nabi sariɲanxine xa a Nii Sariɲanxin barakani. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Na wundo feen nan ito ra fa fala siya gbɛtɛne nun Yahudiyane kɛɛ kedenna sɔtɔma nɛn Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin barakani. E birin bata findi yama kedenna ra alo fati bɛndɛ keden. Ala en tuli sa naxan na, e firinna birin na sɔtɔma nɛn a Muxu Sugandixin Yesu barakani.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Ala bata a sɛnbɛn nawali, a n ki a hinanni, alogo n xa findi Yesu a walikɛɛn na naxan a falan Xibaru Faɲin nalima. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Hali n to xurun muxu sariɲanxine birin xa, anu Ala bata a hinanna ragidi n ma, a n xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe Xibaru Faɲin nɔrɔ tilinxin nali siya gbɛtɛne ma. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>N mɔn xa a makɛnɛn wundo feni ito rakamalima kii naxan yi. Xabu waxati singene, wundoni ito yi luxunxi Daala Mangana Ala xɔn <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>alogo iki kuntigine nun nɔ kanna naxanye bɔxɔn nun koren lan tagini, dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xa Alaa fe kolonna kɛɲaan birin yita ne ra. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Na birin findixi a habadan fe ragidixin nan na, a naxan nakamalixi en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Nayi, en nɔɛ en masoɛ Ala ra nɛn en ma dɛnkɛlɛyani Yesu barakani xaxili ragidini, sikɛ yo mi na. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Nanara, n na ɛ mafanma, ɛ nama yigitɛgɛ n ma tɔrɔne fe ra ɛ tan xa amasɔtɔ ɛ binyen nan ne ra.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bata en xanu kii naxan yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Na nan a ligaxi, n nan n xinbi sinma n Fafe Ala bun ma <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>bɔnsɔnna birin xinla fataxi naxan na naxanye kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna ma. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>N na a maxandima fa fala a xa tin a binyen nɔrɔni, a ɛ sɔbɛ so sɛnbɛni ɛ muxuyaan feene yi a Nii Sariɲanxin barakani, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>alogo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa lu ɛ bɔɲɛni dɛnkɛlɛyaan barakani. N na Ala maxandima ɛ xa, ɛ xa sabati, ɛ bitin xanuntenyani alo salenna <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>alogo ɛ nun yama sariɲanxin birin xa sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ ɛ Alaa Muxu Sugandixina xanuntenyaan gboon nun a tilinna nun a tiden famu, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>ɛ yi a xanuntenyaan kolon naxan dangu kolonna birin na, alogo ɛ xa dɛfe Alaa fe kamalixin birin na.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Nba, sɛnbɛna Ala naxan na, a feen birin liga en xa fata sɛnbɛn na naxan walima en yi, en na naxan maxɔdin hali en nɔɛ en mirɛ naxan ma, mɔn hali dangu en ma miriyane ra pon, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>binyen xa fi na ma dɛnkɛlɛya yamani, e nun Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini, waxatin birin habadan han habadan. Amina!<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xa lu lanna nin alo fati bɛndɛ kedenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>N tan naxan findixi kasorasaan na Marigina fe ra, n na ɛ mafanma, Ala bata ɛ xili naxan liga fe ma, ɛ sigati kiin xa lan na ma. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Ɛ xa ɛ yɛtɛ magodo, ɛ limaniya feen birin yi, ɛ yi diɲa. Ɛ diɲa ɛ bode xa xanuntenyani, <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>ɛ yi kata kiin birin yi alogo Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin lanna naxan fixi ɛ ma, na xa lu ɛ tagi, bɔɲɛ xunbenla yi ɛ tugun ɛ bode ra. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan luxi nɛn alo fati bɛndɛ kedenna. Alaa Nii Sariɲanxi kedenna na a ra alo ɛ xilixi yigi kedenna ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Marigi kedenna na a ra e nun dɛnkɛlɛya kedenna e nun marafu kedenna igeni tubi xinla ma. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Ala kedenna na a ra, muxun birin Fafe naxan seen birin xunna, naxan walima feen birin xɔn, naxan feen birin kui.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Ala bata kisena nde fi en keden kedenna birin ma alo a Muxu Sugandixina en kixi kiseen sifan naxan na. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Nanara, Kitabun naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“A te kore waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">a yi siga suxu muxune ra a yii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">A yi kiseene fi adamadiine ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.8</char> Yaburin 68.19</note><verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Nba, fa fala, “A bata te kore,” na bunna nanse ra? Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala a godo nɛn dunuɲa yi bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Naxan godo dunuɲa yi, na nan mɔn te kore xɔnna ma pon, alogo a xa feen birin nakamali. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>A tan nan kiseene yitaxunxi, a yi muxuna ndee findi xɛrane ra, a yi ndee findi nabine ra, a yi ndee findi Xibaru Faɲin nali muxune ra, a yi ndee findi yɛɛratine ra, a yi ndee findi karamɔxɔne ra. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>A en kixi na kii nin alogo muxu sariɲanxine birin xa nɔ a wanla kɛ, alogo a yamaan xa sabati naxan luxi alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fati bɛndɛna. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Na ligama nɛn han en birin yi findi kedenna ra dɛnkɛlɛyani Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn kolonni. En findi muxu kamalixine ra alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin kamalixi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Nayi, en mi findɛ dii ɲɔrɛne ra sɔnɔn, alo foyen nun ige walanna kunkin xalin kii naxan yi, en yi bira xaranne birin fɔxɔ ra, muxune yi en mayenden e kɔtɛne nun wulene xɔn. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Koni xa en ɲɔndin fala xanuntenyani, en kɔxɔma nɛn, en yi findi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin maligane ra feen birin yi, a tan naxan findixi en xunna ra. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>A tan nan a ligaxi dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xa findi fati bɛndɛ kedenna ra, a muxune yi lu e bode yi alo fati bɛndɛn yirene to tugunxi e bode ra fasane xɔn. Nayi, xa fatin yirene birin a wanla kɛ, a gboma nɛn, a kɔxɔ xanuntenyani.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">En muxuya nɛnɛn naxan sɔtɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Nba, n xa maxadi falani ito ti ɛ xa Marigin xinli: Ɛ nama fa sigan ti alo dɛnkɛlɛyatarene. E miriyane biraxi fufafu feene nan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>E xaxinle yidimixi. E fe mi Alaa nii rakisina fe yi masɔtɔ e fe kolontareyaan nun e bɔɲɛ xɔdɛxɛyaan xɔn. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>E mi fa yagima sɔnɔn. E yi e yɛtɛ findi haramu fe rabane ra alogo e xa fe xɔsixin sifan birin naba han e lu kunfɛ ayi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Koni ɛ tan mi Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe xaranxi na kiini. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Ɛ bata a fe mɛ, ɛ yi xaran Yesu gbee ɲɔndin ma yati. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Fa fala ɛ xa xɛtɛ ɛ dari fe fonne fɔxɔ ra, e nun ɛ muxuya fonna naxan luma ɛ rakunfɛ a ɛ ratantan. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Koni ɛ niin nun ɛ xaxinla xa findi a nɛnɛn na. <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Ɛ mɔn xa muxuya nɛnɛn tongo, Ala muxuyaan naxan daxi a yɛtɛ maligan na, tinxinna nun sariɲanni.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Nanara, ɛ wulen lu, birin yi ɲɔndin fala a muxu bodene xa amasɔtɔ en findixi gbindi kedenna yirene nan na. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Xa ɛ xɔlɔ, ɛ nama hakɛn liga. Ɛ nama lu xɔlɔxi han sogen bira waxatina. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Ɛ mɔn nama fɛrɛn fi Yinna Manga Setana ma. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Xa naxan darixi muɲan tiyɛ, a xa a lu. A xa wali kɛndɛna nde kɛ, alogo a xa seen sɔtɔ a yiigelitɔne maliyɛ naxan na. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Ɛ nama fala kobi yo ti fɔ fala faɲin tun naxan muxune maliyɛ e hayun naxan ma, alogo na xa findi hinanna ra a ramɛ muxune xa. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Ɛ nama Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nasunu, Ala naxan findixi taxamasenna ra ɛ yi han a sa fama ɛ xunbadeni lɔxɔn naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Ɛ ba xɔnnantenyaan nun bɔɲɛ teen nun xɔlɔn nun sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn nun muxu mafalan nun ɲaxuyaan ma ɛ tagi. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Ɛ fanna nun kininkininna yita ɛ bode ra. Ɛ yi ɛ bode mafelu alo Ala bata ɛ mafelu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani kii naxan yi.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛ sigan ti kɛnɛnni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Nanara, ɛ to findixi Ala xanuntenne nan na, ɛ Ala raliga, <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>ɛ sigan ti xanuntenyani alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixina en xanuxi kii naxan yi, a yi a yɛtɛ fi en ma fe ra, a liga alo saraxa baxina Ala xa, naxan gan xiri rafan a ma.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Koni yanga suxun nun fe xɔsixine nun milan nama lu ɛ yɛ, e fe yɛtɛɛn nama fala mumɛ, alo a lan yama sariɲanxini kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Ɛ mɔn nama fe xɔsixine nun xaxilitareya falane nun yagitareya falane ti. Ne mi daxa koni fɔ barika birana. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ xa ito kolon yati, fa fala muxun naxan yanga suxun nun fe xɔsixine nun milɛ feene ligama, na sese mi kɛɛn sɔtɔma Ala nun a Muxu Sugandixina mangayani. Amasɔtɔ milɛn findixi se batun nan na alo suxure kiina.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Ɛ nama tin muxu yo xa ɛ mayenden fala fuune xɔn, amasɔtɔ Alaa xɔlɔn fama fala suxutarene xili ma na fe sifane nan ma fe ra. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Nanara, ɛ nama basan ne ra. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ tan fan yi luxi nɛn alo dimina koni iki ɛ bata lu alo kɛnɛnna Marigin barakani. Nayi, ɛ sigan ti alo kɛnɛnna muxune. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Amasɔtɔ fe faɲin sifan birin nun tinxinyaan nun ɲɔndin fama kɛnɛnna nan xɔn. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Ɛ feene fɛsɛfɛsɛ ɛ Marigin nafan feen kolon. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Ɛ fefe nun dimin kɛwanla fe fuune nama malan, koni fɔ ɛ xa e ramini kɛnɛnna nin. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Amasɔtɔ muxune feen naxanye ligama wundoni, hali ne falan gbansanna mayagi. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Koni kɛnɛnna na sɔnna naxan birinye makɛnɛn, ne yigbɛma nɛn. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan birin na yigbɛ, na bata lu kɛnɛnni. A falaxi na nan ma, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Ɛ tan naxanye xima, ɛ xulun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">ɛ keli faxa muxune tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">nayi Alaa Muxu Sugandixina ɛ luma nɛn kɛnɛnni.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Nayi, ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma ɛ sigati kiini, ɛ nama lu alo fe kolontarene, koni alo fe kolonne. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Ɛ fɛrɛn fen waxatine ma, amasɔtɔ waxatini itoe mi fan. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Nanara, ɛ nama findi xaxilitarene ra, koni ɛ kata Marigin sagoon kolon feen na.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Ɛ nama lugo dɔlɔn na, amasɔtɔ xurutareyaan nan na ra, koni ɛ lugo Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin na. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Nba, ɛ falan ti ɛ bode xa Yaburi falane nun bɛtine nun Ala tantun sigi sariɲanxine yi, ɛ bɛtin ba Marigin xa, ɛ yi a tantun ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na! <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Ɛ barikan bira Fafe Ala xa seen birin ma fe yi waxatin birin en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xinli.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanle nun e xɛmɛne fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Ɛ xuru ɛ bode ma Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yɛɛragaxuni. <verse eid="EPH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Ɲaxanle, ɛ xuru ɛ xɛmɛne ma alo ɛ a ligama Marigin xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Amasɔtɔ xɛmɛn nan ɲaxanla xunna ra, alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xunna ra kii naxan yi, naxan luxi alo a fati bɛndɛna, a naxan nakisixi. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Ɲaxanle lanma nɛn e yi xuru e xɛmɛne ma feen birin yi alo dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xuruxi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Xɛmɛne, ɛ fan xa ɛ ɲaxanle xanu alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xanu kii naxan yi, a yi a yɛtɛ fi e fe ra, <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>alogo a xa e rasariɲan, a yi e rafixa igen nun fala xuiin xɔn,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.26</char> A muxune rasariɲanma <char style="fk">igeni</char>, a e rafu e tubi xinla ma. A mato Tito 3.5 kui. A mɔn muxune rasariɲanma Yesu nun a <char style="fk">fala xuiin xɔn</char>. A mato Yoni 1.1 nun 15.3 kui.</note> <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>alogo a xa e ti a yɛtagi yama nɔrɔxin na, alo lɔxɔ yo mi dugin naxan na, a mi yiɲɔrɔnmɔnxi, fɛ yo mi a ra koni yama sariɲanxin na a ra fɛtareyani. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Xɛmɛne lan e xa e ɲaxanle xanu na kii nin alo e yɛtɛ gbindina. Xɛmɛn naxan a ɲaxanla xanuma, na bata a yɛtɛ xanu. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Muxu yo munma a yɛtɛ fati bɛndɛn naɲaxu singen. Koni a a dɛgema nɛn ki faɲi, a yi a masuxu alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan masuxuma kii naxan yi <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>amasɔtɔ a fati bɛndɛn yirene nan en tan na. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Kitabun naxa, “Nanara, xɛmɛna a nga nun a fafe beɲinma, a yi a maso a ɲaxanla ra, e findi fati bɛndɛ kedenna ra.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.31</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 2.24</note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Wundo gbeen nan ito ra, koni n na Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nun dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan nan ma fe falama. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Koni ɛ fan birin xa ɛ ɲaxanla xanu alo ɛ yɛtɛna, ɲaxanla fan yi a xɛmɛn binya.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Diine nun e sɔtɔ muxune fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Diine, ɛ ɛ sɔtɔ muxune fala xuiin suxu Marigina fe ra, amasɔtɔ na nan tinxin. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>Yamari singen nan ito ra tuli saan saxi naxan fari, a naxa, “I baba nun i nga binya <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>alogo i xa hɛrin nun siimaya xunkuyen sɔtɔ dunuɲa yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.3</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 20.12 nun Sariyane 5.16 kui.</note><verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Dii fafane, ɛ nama ɛ diine raxɔlɔ. Koni ɛ e xuru, ɛ yi e maxadi Marigina kiraan xɔn.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Konyine nun e kanne fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Konyine, ɛ kanne fala xuiin suxu naxanye ɛ xun na dunuɲa yi, ɛ yi e binya, ɛ gaxu e yɛɛ ra. Ɛ e sagoon liga ɛ bɔɲɛ faɲin na alo ɛ a ligama Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa kii naxan yi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Ɛ nama a liga e yɛ xɔnna gbansan xan yi, alogo ɛ xa rafan e ma, koni alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yɛtɛna konyine, ɛ Ala sagoon liga ɛ bɔɲɛn birin na. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Ɛ wali e xa ɲɛnige faɲini, alo ɛ walima Marigin nan xa, muxune mi a ra. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Bayo ɛ a kolon fa fala Marigin muxun birin saranma nɛn a wali faɲin na, xa a findi konyin na hanma xɔrɔna.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Konyi kanne, ɛ fan xa a liga ɛ konyine xa na kiini. Ɛ nama ɛ kɔnkɔ e ma. Ɛ xa a kolon, a ɛ nun ɛ konyine birin kari keden peen sa ariyanna yi, naxan mi muxune rafisama a bode xa.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa yɛngɛ so seene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Falani soxin naxan na, ɛ sɔbɛ so Marigina fe yi a sɛnbɛn barakaxini. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Ɛ Alaa yɛngɛ so seene birin tongo alogo ɛ xa nɔ tiyɛ Yinna Manga Setanaa kɔtɛne birin yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Amasɔtɔ en mi adamadiine xan yɛngɛma, koni kuntigine nun nɔ kanne nun sɛnbɛ kanna naxanye dunuɲa yidimixini ito xun na, e nun yinna ɲaxin naxanye koren nun bɔxɔn lan tagini. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Nanara, iki ɛ xa Alaa yɛngɛ so seene birin tongo alogo waxati ɲaxin na a li, ɛ xa nɔ tiyɛ na yaxune yɛɛ ra, ɛ yi nɔɔn ti feen birin yi, ɛ yi lu ɛ funfuni ken!<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Nanara, ɛ xa ti ken! Ɲɔndin yi findi ɛ tagi xidin na, tinxinyaan yi findi ɛ kanke yɛ masansanna ra. <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>Ɛ mayitɔnna nun ɛ wɛkilɛn xa lu alo ɛ sankidina ɛ sanni Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nalideni naxan bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyaan xa lu ɛ yi alo ɛ yɛ masansan wure lefana ɛ yii ɛ Fe Ɲaxin Kanna xalimakuli radɛgɛxine birin natuun naxan na. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Ɛ xa kisi feen nasuxu alo xunna makantan wure kɔmɔtina, ɛ Alaa falan lu ɛ yii Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina silanfanna ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.17</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Ɛ Ala maxandi waxatin birin Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin barakani Ala maxandin sifan birin yi. Ɛ lu ɛ yɛɛ ra yi na ma, ɛ tunnafan Ala maxandin ma yama sariɲanxin birin ma fe ra waxatin birin. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Ɛ Ala maxandi n fan xa, alogo n na keli fala tideni waxatin naxan yi, Ala xa falan so n yii, n yi n wɛkilɛ Xibaru Faɲin wundo feen makɛnɛndeni yamaan xa, <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>n findixi xɛraan na naxan ma fe ra hali n to xidixi yɔlɔnxɔnna ra iki. Ɛ Ala maxandi, alogo n xa n wɛkilɛ falan tideni alo n daxa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɔntɔn dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>En nafan ngaxakedenna nun en walikɛ bode tɔgɔndiyaxin Tikiko naxan walima Marigin xa, na n ma fe birin yɛbama nɛn ɛ xa, alogo ɛ fan xa n ma fe xibarune kolon e nun n feen naxanye ligama. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>N na a rasigama ɛ ma na nan ma alogo ɛ xa nxɔ fe kolon, a yi ɛ ralimaniya.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Fafe Ala nun Marigi Yesu a Muxu Sugandixin xa bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun xanuntenyaan nun dɛnkɛlɛyaan fi en ngaxakedenne birin ma. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Naxanye xanuntenyaan mi ɲanma en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa, Ala xa hinan ne ra.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
